# Runtime allowlist: never send secrets, agent caches, tests or local browser
# artifacts to the image build. Add new runtime directories here deliberately.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server.js
!src/
!src/**
!public/
!public/**

# Local scratch files remain excluded even inside runtime directories.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
